document.write(window.location.toString());
</script></div></div><div id="block-breadcrumbs" data-block-plugin-id="system_breadcrumb_block" class="block-breadcrumbs block block-system block-system-breadcrumb-block"> <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" role="navigation" aria-labelledby="system-breadcrumb"><h2 id="system-breadcrumb" class="show-for-sr">Breadcrumb</h2><ul class="breadcrumbs"><li class="breadcrumbs__li"> <a href="/" class="breadcrumbs__home breadcrumbs__link"><img alt="Home" class="breadcrumbs__home-img" width="14" height="14" src="/themes/custom/mc_base21/images/Icons/Icon/Home_White@2x.svg" /></a></li><li class="breadcrumbs__li"> <a href="/student-experience" class="breadcrumbs__not-home breadcrumbs__link">The Student Experience</a></li><li class="current show-for-sr"><span>Current: </span> Athletics at Madison College</li></ul> </nav></div></div></div> </header><div class="grid-container main-grid__wrapper-wrapper full"><div class="grid-x grid-margin-x main-grid__wrapper"> <main id="main" class="cell" role="main"><div class="region-highlighted panel"><div data-drupal-messages-fallback class="hidden"></div></div> <a id="main-content"></a> <section><div><div id="block-mc-future-content" data-block-plugin-id="system_main_block" class="block-mc-future-content block block-system block-system-main-block"> <article ><div class="view-mode-full"><div class="field field-node--field-basic-plug-and-play field--name--field-basic-plug-and-play field--type--entity-reference-revisions field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item"><div class="paragraph paragraph--type--layout paragraph--view-mode--default bg-dark-blue"><div class="grid-container grid-container__wrapper-padding"><div class="grid-x grid-padding-x"><div class="cell medium-5"><div class="paragraph paragraph--type--text-editor paragraph--view-mode--default"><div class="field field-paragraph--field-par-text-editor field--name--field-par-text-editor field--type--text-long field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item"><p class="lead"><strong>Sports add so much to the college experience.</strong> From intercollegiate athletics to intramurals and youth programs, there are plenty of games to play and watch at Madison College.</p><p class="lead">Not into the team thing? Set your own pace at the Fitness Center. We have everything you need to keep fit and clean up for class.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="cell medium-6 medium-offset-1"><div class="paragraph paragraph--type--text-editor paragraph--view-mode--default"><div class="field field-paragraph--field-par-text-editor field--name--field-par-text-editor field--type--text-long field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item"><div><div class="field field-media--field-media-image field--name--field-media-image field--type--image field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item"> <img loading="lazy" src="/files/styles/original_webp/public/media-image/2025-08/Madison%20College%20Men%27s%20Soccer%20Team%20in%20action.jpg.webp?itok=wni0Tnmc" width="1148" height="646" alt="Men's soccer team playing a home game during sunset"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="field-item"><div class="paragraph paragraph--type--layout paragraph--view-mode--default bg-light-grayish-blue"><div class="grid-container grid-container__wrapper-padding"><div class="grid-x grid-padding-x"><div class="cell medium-5"><div class="paragraph paragraph--type--text-editor paragraph--view-mode--default"><div class="field field-paragraph--field-par-text-editor field--name--field-par-text-editor field--type--text-long field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item"><div class="align-center"><div class="youtube-video__wrapper"> <button data-open="mc-media-15186" class="youtube-video__link"> <img class="youtube-video__thumbnail" alt="Madison College: Goodman Sports Complex" src="/files/styles/video/public/oembed_thumbnails/77fpU3anGUKoWvaBR32gQPfwKM7H7RTG3rvhokUOJ0Q.jpg.webp?itok=MqpfDkjI" width="690" height="388" loading="lazy"> </button><div class="reveal large media-remote-video youtube-video__reveal" id="mc-media-15186" data-reveal data-reset-on-close="true" data-youtube-id="4YtapILtShk"> <button class="youtube-video__reveal-close-button close-button" data-close aria-label="Exit video popup" type="button"> <span aria-hidden="true">×</span> </button><div class="youtube-video__inner responsive-embed widescreen"><iframe class="embed-responsive-item" src id="video-iframe--mc-media-15186" allowscriptaccess="always" allowfullscreen="allowfullscreen" frameborder="0" modestbranding="0"></iframe></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="cell medium-6 medium-offset-1"><div class="paragraph paragraph--type--text-editor paragraph--view-mode--default"><div class="field field-paragraph--field-par-text-editor field--name--field-par-text-editor field--type--text-long field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item"><h2>Check out the Irwin A. and Robert D. Goodman Sports Complex</h2></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="field-item"><div class="paragraph paragraph--type--layout paragraph--view-mode--default"><div class="grid-container grid-container__wrapper-padding"><div class="grid-x grid-padding-x"><div class="cell medium-8"><div class="paragraph paragraph--type--text-editor paragraph--view-mode--default"><div class="field field-paragraph--field-par-text-editor field--name--field-par-text-editor field--type--text-long field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item"><h2>Go WolfPack!</h2><p>Madison College is part of the National Junior College Athletic Association (NJCAA) and Region 4. Come out and cheer on our men’s and women’s teams in basketball, soccer, baseball, softball, volleyball, golf and Esports.&nbsp;<br><a href="https://madisoncollegeathletics.com/index" target="_blank">madisoncollegeathletics.com</a></p><h2>Get geared up</h2><p>Show your Madison College pride with our collection of spirit and sportswear. We outfit all ages from head to toe.<br><a href="https://www.prepsportswear.com/college/us/wisconsin/madison/madison-college-athletics?schoolid=2560168" target="_blank">prepsportswear.com</a></p><h2>Join a team</h2><p>If you’re new to college life or a seasoned pro, make friends and stay in shape by playing an intramural sport. Not a student? The Madison College Challenge Course has programs available to anyone in the community. Check it out!</p><h2>Hit the gym</h2><p>Everything to keep you moving and feeling great. Cardio equipment, weights, basketball courts and classes. Heading straight to class or work? We have locker facilities where you can shower and change.<br><a href="https://madisoncollegerecreation.com" target="_blank">madisoncollegerecreation.com</a></p><h2>Accidents happen</h2><p>Don’t ignore that twisted ankle or banged up elbow. Madison College students have access to an on-campus clinic for treatment of minor injuries and illnesses. And our 24-hour Nurse Connect line is staffed 24/7.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="cell medium-4"><div class="paragraph paragraph--type--text-editor paragraph--view-mode--default"><div class="field field-paragraph--field-par-text-editor field--name--field-par-text-editor field--type--text-long field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item"><div class="align-center"><div class="field field-media--field-media-image field--name--field-media-image field--type--image field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item"> <img loading="lazy" src="/files/styles/original_webp/public/media-image/2021-07/madison-college-athletics-logo-400x400.jpg.webp?itok=4Ry-p8O8" width="400" height="400" alt="Madison College athletics logo"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="paragraph paragraph--type--stat-widget paragraph--view-mode--default"><div class="stat-widget__wrapper align-middle"><div class="stat-widget__image-container"><div class="stat-widget__stat stat-widget__stat--small typography--stat-headline"><div class="field field-paragraph--field-stat-widget-stat field--name--field-stat-widget-stat field--type--string field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item">Don&#039;t miss the big game!</div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="paragraph paragraph--type--text-editor paragraph--view-mode--default"><div class="field field-paragraph--field-par-text-editor field--name--field-par-text-editor field--type--text-long field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item"><p class="text-align-center"><a class="button--wysiwyg" href="https://madisoncollegeathletics.com/calendar" target="_blank">View the Athletics Calendar!</a></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="field-item"><div class="paragraph paragraph--type--reuse-full-width-widget paragraph--view-mode--default"><div class="field field-paragraph--field-full-width-widget-content field--name--field-full-width-widget-content field--type--entity-reference field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item"><article id="node-5191" class="grid-container__wrapper-padding align-center contact__wrapper"><div class="grid-container grid-container__double-small"><div class="contact__headline"><div class="field field-node--field-contact-headline field--name--field-contact-headline field--type--string field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item">Contact Student Life</div></div></div></div><div class="grid-x grid-padding-x"><div class="contact__body-left cell"><div class="field field-node--field-contact-body-left field--name--field-contact-body-left field--type--text-long field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item"><p class="lead">Madison Truax Campus<br>Main Building, B1260</p><p>1701 Wright Street<br>Madison, Wisconsin 53704</p><p><a href="mailto:studentlife@madisoncollege.edu">studentlife@madisoncollege.edu</a><br><a href="tel:+16082466224">608.246.6224</a></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></article></div></div></div></div></div><div class="field-item"><div class="paragraph paragraph--type--layout paragraph--view-mode--default"><div class="admin-only-full-width"><div ></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></article></div></div> </section> </main></div></div> <footer class="footer" id="footer"><div class="grid-container grid-container__double-small footer__content"><div class="grid-x grid-padding-x"><div class="cell small-12 medium-3"> <img src="/themes/custom/mc_base21/images/Icons/MATC_Logo/Horizontal_width_168px.webp" width="168" height="94" class="footer__logo" alt="Madison Area Technical College Logo" loading="lazy" /></div><div class="cell small-12 medium-6"> <a href="/about" class="footer__links--title">About Madison College</a><ul class="footer__links-list"><li class="footer__links-list__item"> <a href="/about/leadership" class="footer__links-list__anchor">Governance and Leadership</a></li><li class="footer__links-list__item"> <a href="/about/schools-departments" class="footer__links-list__anchor">Schools and Departments</a></li><li class="footer__links-list__item"> <a href="/about/directory" class="footer__links-list__anchor">Campus Directory</a></li><li class="footer__links-list__item"> <a href="/about/careers" class="footer__links-list__anchor">Careers at Madison College</a></li><li class="footer__links-list__item"> <a href="/about/community" class="footer__links-list__anchor">Community Services and Partnerships</a></li><li class="footer__links-list__item"> <a href="/about/public-information" class="footer__links-list__anchor">Public Information</a></li><li class="footer__links-list__item"> <a href="/about/alumni" class="footer__links-list__anchor">Alumni Resources</a></li><li class="footer__links-list__item"> <a href="https://www.supportmadisoncollege.org" class="footer__links-list__anchor">Madi